2) Tuning tips (what you’ll actually tweak)
	•	MESSAGE_THRESHOLD = 8 is just a starting point.
	•	Many people also route on:
	•	last user message length
	•	total chars across messages
	•	tool-use required vs not (if you add tools later)

But for exactly what you asked: len(messages) routing is already solid.

